458
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:21,760
the sound of the crowd.

459
00:29:24,080 --> 00:29:25,720
I still remember it all.

460
00:29:29,160 --> 00:29:32,800
And I hope that someday,

461
00:29:33,560 --> 00:29:36,160
I'll get to stand on
a stage like that again.

462
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:44,840
What if today doesn't turn out
the way you imagined?

463
00:29:47,200 --> 00:29:48,520
No way.

464
00:29:49,320 --> 00:29:51,000
Because I…

465
00:29:51,080 --> 00:29:52,560
