466
00:29:55,480 --> 00:29:56,600
What's that?

467
00:29:58,520 --> 00:30:00,240
Try closing your eyes

468
00:30:00,320 --> 00:30:04,360
and think about what you want to happen.

469
00:30:05,960 --> 00:30:08,000
- Close my eyes?
- Yeah, close your eyes.

470
00:30:09,560 --> 00:30:11,080
Try it.

471
00:30:27,080 --> 00:30:28,240
Now,

472
00:30:29,480 --> 00:30:31,360
