473
00:30:32,280 --> 00:30:34,560
What do you want to happen?

474
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:38,760
The singing onstage,

475
00:30:39,480 --> 00:30:41,520
the crowd screaming…

476
00:30:42,600 --> 00:30:45,320
Picture all those things in your mind.

477
00:30:46,800 --> 00:30:48,440
Make yourself feel like

478
00:30:49,000 --> 00:30:51,480
the moment you open your eyes,

479
00:30:52,080 --> 00:30:53,440
that dream

480
00:30:54,240 --> 00:30:56,240
will be right in front of you.

481
00:31:06,720 --> 00:31:07,880
You can open your eyes now.

482
00:31:10,000 --> 00:31:10,960
Phatee-Ranne!

483
00:31:11,560 --> 00:31:14,240
Phatee-Ranne! Phatee-Ranne!

484
00:31:14,320 --> 00:31:15,680
Phatee-Ranne!

485
00:31:15,760 --> 00:31:17,120
Phatee-Ranne!

486
00:31:17,200 --> 00:31:18,720
Phatee-Ranne!

487
00:31:18,800 --> 00:31:20,160
Phatee-Ranne!

